          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bathi: Umuntu ongumbusi walelolizwe wasihalada kakhulu, wathi siyizinhloli zelizwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thina sathi kuye: Singabaqotho; kasisizo izinhloli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "siyizelamani ezilitshumi lambili, amadodana omuntu munye; enye kayisekho, lenye encinyane ikubaba khathesinje elizweni laseKanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lowomuntu ongumbusi welizwe wathi kithi: Ngizakubona ngalokhu ukuba lingabantu abaqotho yini; tshiyani omunye wabafowenu kimi, lihambe lise amabele kwabakini abalambayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lilethe umnawenu omncinyane kimi; ng’khona ngizakubona ukuthi kalisizo izinhloli kodwa lingabaqotho, ngilinike umfowenu, lithenge elizweni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
