          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJakobe wathi: Umntanami kayikuhamba lani, ngoba umfowabo sewafa, kusele yena yedwa; uba esehlelwa yingozi endleleni elihamba ngayo, lizakwehlisela endaweni yabafileyo izimvi zami ngosizi.",
          "type": "text",
